{
  "id": "p14",
  "title": "The Village Movie Night",
  "titleZh": "村庄电影夜",
  "topic": "乡村",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Those two long wooden tables are carried by the young helpers.",
        "zh": "那两张长木桌由年轻的帮手抬着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We also see a small stage under the old brick wall.",
        "zh": "我们也看到老砖墙下有一个小舞台。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My friends leave the heavy bag near the front gate.",
        "zh": "我的朋友们把沉重的袋子放在前门附近。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our social club will book the town hall for one long night.",
        "zh": "我们的社交俱乐部会订下镇礼堂一整晚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My parents talk about whether the whole idea is fair.",
        "zh": "我的父母谈论整个想法是否公平。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the low price today brings many more people to us.",
        "zh": "于是今天低价给我们带来了更多的人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We wait until everyone agrees about the final choice.",
        "zh": "我们一直等到大家都同意最后的选项。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Half of the income shows a clear increase this week.",
        "zh": "收入的一半显示出本周明显的增长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Eight adults and nineteen children come to the first show.",
        "zh": "八个大人和十九个孩子来看了第一场演出。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The movie star signs a card and passes a quick test.",
        "zh": "那位电影明星签了张卡片，还快速通过了测试。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Her steady hand makes a real difference to the whole team.",
        "zh": "她稳稳的手给整个团队带来了真正的改变。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A personal gift hangs on a branch of the old tree.",
        "zh": "一件私人礼物挂在那棵老树的一根树枝上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our village keeps a short note beside the front door.",
        "zh": "我们村在前门旁边留了一张短笺。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Do not throw the heavy ball at yourself or others.",
        "zh": "不要用那个重球砸你自己或别人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The cold air moves every small object on the shelf.",
        "zh": "冷空气吹动架子上的每一样小东西。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My main point about this new plan is very clear.",
        "zh": "我对这个新计划的主要观点非常清楚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A soft wind blows through the open kitchen door.",
        "zh": "一阵轻柔的风穿过敞开的厨房门。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A cheap ticket and a short interview bring new guests.",
        "zh": "一张便宜的票和一次简短的面试带来了新客人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then nobody stays alone, and all guests feel welcome.",
        "zh": "于是没有人独自待着，所有客人都感到受欢迎。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A pretty lamp hides the weak light of the old stage.",
        "zh": "一盏漂亮的灯遮住了旧舞台微弱的光。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Our guest speaker asks for ice and a clean cup.",
        "zh": "我们的嘉宾演讲者要了冰块和一个干净的杯子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A tall gentleman buys a tiny gift for his young son.",
        "zh": "一位高个子绅士给他年幼的儿子买了一件小礼物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A thick card holds a short lesson about the deep sea.",
        "zh": "一张厚卡片上写着关于深海的一堂短课。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our dear cook brings warm bread to the long table.",
        "zh": "我们亲爱的厨师把热面包端到长桌上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later people celebrate everywhere with music and bright lights.",
        "zh": "后来人们到处庆祝，伴着音乐和明亮的灯光。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We dig a small pool and call it our own ocean.",
        "zh": "我们挖了一个小水池，管它叫我们自己的海洋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small toy sits beside a warm bowl of rice.",
        "zh": "一件小玩具放在一碗热米饭旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The referendum originally asked about a very different question.",
        "zh": "这场公投原本问的是一个完全不同的问题。"
      }
    ]
  ],
